{
  "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentTemplate.json#",
  "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "comment": [
      "The callback behind the approval card's buttons.",
      "",
      "A card posted through a Teams incoming webhook has no bot behind it, so",
      "Action.Submit does nothing. The buttons are links, and this is what they",
      "link to: it records the human's decision in the same approvals table the",
      "agent polls.",
      "",
      "GET NEVER CHANGES ANYTHING. The link opens a confirmation page and the",
      "page's button POSTs. This is not ceremony: a link in a Teams message is",
      "fetched by preview generators, scanners and prefetchers, and the first",
      "version of this recorded a decision on GET. An approval that can be",
      "granted by a link preview is not a human approval, it is a URL.",
      "",
      "The write is conditional on the ETag read moments earlier, not 'If-Match:",
      "*'. With '*', an Approve and a Decline arriving together could both pass",
      "the 'already answered?' check and then overwrite each other, and the last",
      "writer would win silently. Now the loser gets 412 and is told so.",
      "",
      "Why a Logic App and not a Power Automate flow: the Azure Table connector",
      "authenticates with a shared account key, and allowSharedKeyAccess is false",
      "on this storage account by tenant policy. An HTTP-triggered flow is also a",
      "premium trigger. This uses a system-assigned managed identity against the",
      "Table REST API instead, so there is no key anywhere.",
      "",
      "KNOWN LIMITATION: the responder is not an authenticated identity. Anyone",
      "holding the link can answer, and the recorded name is whatever the query",
      "string claimed, so it is stored as 'responder_claimed' rather than as an",
      "audit fact. Put the workflow behind Entra authentication if you need to",
      "know who actually clicked.",
      "",
      "It refuses a request that does not exist, one already answered, one that",
      "has expired, and one whose fingerprint does not match the link. The agent",
      "revalidates all of that independently - this is defence in depth, not the",
      "control itself."
    ]
  },
  "parameters": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "bi-triage-approval-callback"
    },
    "location": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "[resourceGroup().location]"
    },
    "tableEndpoint": {
      "type": "string",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "e.g. https://<storage-account>.table.core.windows.net"
      }
    },
    "tableName": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "approvals"
    },
    "owner": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "unassigned",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Tag value only. Set it to whoever should be asked before this is deleted."
      }
    },
    "costCenter": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "unassigned",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Tag value only. Your chargeback code."
      }
    },
    "environment": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "evaluation",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Tag value only, e.g. evaluation, test, production."
      }
    }
  },
  "variables": {
    "entityPrefix": "[concat(parameters('tableEndpoint'), '/', parameters('tableName'), '(PartitionKey=''approval'',RowKey=''')]",
    "storageAudience": "https://storage.azure.com/"
  },
  "resources": [
    {
      "type": "Microsoft.Logic/workflows",
      "apiVersion": "2019-05-01",
      "name": "[parameters('name')]",
      "location": "[parameters('location')]",
      "identity": {
        "type": "SystemAssigned"
      },
      "tags": {
        "CostCenter": "[parameters('costCenter')]",
        "Owner": "[parameters('owner')]",
        "Environment": "[parameters('environment')]",
        "DataClassification": "synthetic"
      },
      "properties": {
        "state": "Enabled",
        "definition": {
          "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
          "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
          "parameters": {
            "entityPrefix": {
              "type": "String",
              "defaultValue": "[variables('entityPrefix')]"
            },
            "storageAudience": {
              "type": "String",
              "defaultValue": "[variables('storageAudience')]"
            }
          },
          "triggers": {
            "manual": {
              "type": "Request",
              "kind": "Http",
              "inputs": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "actions": {
            "Is_it_a_confirmation": {
              "type": "If",
              "runAfter": {},
              "expression": {
                "and": [
                  {
                    "equals": [
                      "@toupper(triggerOutputs()['method'])",
                      "POST"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "actions": {
                "Read_the_request": {
                  "type": "Http",
                  "runAfter": {},
                  "inputs": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "uri": "@{parameters('entityPrefix')}@{encodeUriComponent(triggerOutputs()['queries']['request_id'])}')",
                    "headers": {
                      "x-ms-version": "2019-02-02",
                      "Accept": "application/json;odata=minimalmetadata"
                    },
                    "authentication": {
                      "type": "ManagedServiceIdentity",
                      "audience": "@parameters('storageAudience')"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "Is_it_answerable": {
                  "type": "If",
                  "runAfter": {
                    "Read_the_request": [
                      "Succeeded"
                    ]
                  },
                  "expression": {
                    "and": [
                      {
                        "equals": [
                          "@empty(coalesce(body('Read_the_request')?['decision'], ''))",
                          true
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "equals": [
                          "@coalesce(body('Read_the_request')?['fingerprint'], '')",
                          "@coalesce(triggerOutputs()['queries']?['fingerprint'], '')"
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "less": [
                          "@utcNow()",
                          "@coalesce(body('Read_the_request')?['expires_at'], '9999-01-01T00:00:00Z')"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "actions": {
                    "Record_the_decision": {
                      "type": "Http",
                      "runAfter": {},
                      "inputs": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "uri": "@{parameters('entityPrefix')}@{encodeUriComponent(triggerOutputs()['queries']['request_id'])}')",
                        "headers": {
                          "x-ms-version": "2019-02-02",
                          "Content-Type": "application/json",
                          "Accept": "application/json;odata=nometadata",
                          "X-HTTP-Method": "MERGE",
                          "If-Match": "@{coalesce(outputs('Read_the_request')?['headers']?['ETag'], '*')}"
                        },
                        "body": {
                          "decision": "@{triggerOutputs()['queries']['decision']}",
                          "responder_claimed": "@{coalesce(triggerOutputs()['queries']?['responder'], 'teams-card')}",
                          "reason": "@{coalesce(triggerOutputs()['queries']?['reason'], '')}",
                          "decided_at": "@{utcNow()}"
                        },
                        "authentication": {
                          "type": "ManagedServiceIdentity",
                          "audience": "@parameters('storageAudience')"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "Confirm": {
                      "type": "Response",
                      "kind": "Http",
                      "runAfter": {
                        "Record_the_decision": [
                          "Succeeded"
                        ]
                      },
                      "inputs": {
                        "statusCode": 200,
                        "headers": {
                          "Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
                        },
                        "body": "<!doctype html><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Decision recorded</title><body style=\"background:#0d1117;color:#e8edf4;font:16px/1.6 'Segoe UI',sans-serif;padding:48px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:26px;margin:0 0 12px\">Decision recorded</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><b>@{triggerOutputs()['queries']['decision']}</b> &mdash; @{triggerOutputs()['queries']['request_id']}</p><p style=\"color:#9fb0c3\">The agent picks this up on its next poll. You can close this tab.</p>"
                      }
                    },
                    "Lost_the_race": {
                      "type": "Response",
                      "kind": "Http",
                      "runAfter": {
                        "Record_the_decision": [
                          "Failed",
                          "TimedOut"
                        ]
                      },
                      "inputs": {
                        "statusCode": 409,
                        "headers": {
                          "Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
                        },
                        "body": "<!doctype html><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Not recorded</title><body style=\"background:#0d1117;color:#e8edf4;font:16px/1.6 'Segoe UI',sans-serif;padding:48px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:26px;margin:0 0 12px\">Not recorded</h1><p style=\"color:#9fb0c3\">Someone answered this request at the same moment. Their decision stands and nothing here was changed.</p>"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "else": {
                    "actions": {
                      "Refuse": {
                        "type": "Response",
                        "kind": "Http",
                        "runAfter": {},
                        "inputs": {
                          "statusCode": 409,
                          "headers": {
                            "Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
                          },
                          "body": "<!doctype html><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Not recorded</title><body style=\"background:#0d1117;color:#e8edf4;font:16px/1.6 'Segoe UI',sans-serif;padding:48px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:26px;margin:0 0 12px\">Not recorded</h1><p style=\"color:#9fb0c3\">This request was already answered, has expired, or the link does not match it. Nothing was changed.</p>"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "else": {
                "actions": {
                  "Ask_for_confirmation": {
                    "type": "Response",
                    "kind": "Http",
                    "runAfter": {},
                    "inputs": {
                      "statusCode": 200,
                      "headers": {
                        "Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
                      },
                      "body": "<!doctype html><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Confirm decision</title><body style=\"background:#0d1117;color:#e8edf4;font:16px/1.6 'Segoe UI',sans-serif;padding:48px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:26px;margin:0 0 12px\">Confirm decision</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">You are about to record <b>@{triggerOutputs()['queries']['decision']}</b> for request <code>@{triggerOutputs()['queries']['request_id']}</code>.</p><p style=\"color:#9fb0c3;margin:0 0 24px\">Nothing has been changed yet.</p><form method=\"POST\" action=\"@{listCallbackUrl()}\"><button type=\"submit\" style=\"background:#2ea043;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 22px;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer\">Confirm @{triggerOutputs()['queries']['decision']}</button></form>"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "outputs": {}
        },
        "parameters": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "outputs": {
    "principalId": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "[reference(resourceId('Microsoft.Logic/workflows', parameters('name')), '2019-05-01', 'full').identity.principalId]"
    }
  }
}
